export anchor MetroTilesStyle:
    number: 36
    screen: TaskBoard
    name: Metro tiles
    idea: Flat solid colour tiles packed edge to edge with hairline white gaps, where big thin lowercase type does all the work and nothing has a border or a shadow.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #ffffff, the page and the 4px gaps between tiles
        night: #1a1a1a, text, the add task button and the overdue tile
        field: #ececec, the search field fill and the secondary button
        muted: #5c5c5c, small labels on white
        teal: #005f73, the to do head tile, with #0a6e84 card tiles
        cobalt: #1e4fb4, the in progress head tile, with #2a5cc2 card tiles, and field focus
        plum: #7b2d8e, the review head tile, with #8a3a9e card tiles, and the avatar
        leaf: #2f6b1e, the done head tile, with #3a7a28 card tiles
        ember: #a33a00, the at risk tile
        sun: #ffd23f, the overdue word and date on the night tile
    type:
        Segoe UI Light, Segoe UI, Helvetica Neue, Noto Sans, Open Sans,
        Arial, sans-serif. The project title is 64px weight 200, column
        counts 72px weight 100, column names 28px weight 200, tile titles
        22px weight 300, points 40px weight 100, facts 14px weight 400 and
        field labels 13px weight 400. Everything is lowercase except
        people's names.
    layout:
        A white top area with brightwork lowercase on the left and Mara
        Okafor with a square plum MO tile on the right. Below it the huge
        thin title mobile app 2.0 beside a solid ember at risk tile. A
        pivot row of filters reads assignee, label and due as small labels
        over big thin dropdown text, then the search tasks field and a black
        add task tile on the right. The board runs edge to edge across the
        full viewport in four columns with 4px white gaps. Each column has a
        darker head tile with the name top left and a huge count bottom
        right, then one solid tile per task with the title, big points top
        right and one fact line at the bottom with the hash label, the
        assignee and a calendar date. Below 1040px two columns, below 640px
        one, with the head tile in a single row.
    spacing: 4px gaps between tiles, 16px by 20px tile padding, a 32px page gutter above the board and none beside it.
    density: Sparse type in big blocks. One fact line per tile, tiles at least 168px tall.
    corners: 0 everywhere.
    borders: None. Fields carry a 3px inset bottom bar in night so they still read as fields.
    shadows: None. Depth comes only from a darker head tile above lighter task tiles.
    icons:
        Square-cap 1.5 stroke glyphs at text size, white on tiles and
        never boxed. The overdue tile turns night with a triangle and the
        word overdue in sun. Done tiles show a tick and the word done.
    focus: On tiles a 3px white outline inset 9px. On white a 3px night outline offset 2px. A focused field turns white with a 3px cobalt inset ring.
    tone: Lowercase and terse, such as add task, at risk, no due date, while people keep their capitals.
